  14:     - Find the minimum right edge column among the middle-color runs.
  15:     - In each row, keep the run width and the trailing right-side color count.
  16:     - Place the middle-color run so its right edge is at that minimum column, unless the run is too wide, in which case start it at column 0.
  17:     - Fill any remaining non-trailing cells with the left-side color.
  18: 
